action
  KEY                    TYPE    ENUM  SCOPES         DEFAULT  HELP
  actions_enabled        bool          config:write            Whether the action plane is enabled.
  action_reverse_secret  secret        secrets:write           Reverse-channel HMAC secret (write-only).

kb
  KEY       TYPE  ENUM                               SCOPES        DEFAULT  HELP
  provider  enum  intercom|supporthero|knowledgeowl  config:write           KB provider.
  base_url  url                                      config:write           KB API base URL.

settings
  KEY           TYPE    ENUM                           SCOPES        DEFAULT                 HELP
  max_run_usd   float                                  config:write  1                       Per-run cost-cap base in USD.
  models.agent  object                                 config:write  {"tier":"standard"}     Agent loop model selection.
    .tier       enum    standard|pro|max                                                     Ladder rung.
    .model      model                                                                        Pinned model override.
    .effort     enum    minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh                                        Reasoning effort.
  models.image  object                                 config:write  {"model":"vendor/img"}  Image-describe model selection.
    .model      model                                                                        Pinned model override.
